description: "Keep wbic16/mutable-os in sync with argimenes/mutable-os: a phext band (emise/phext-support, upstream-bound) and an SSO band (emise/sso) kept downstream always — only ever rebased on top of the phext band, with a checkable band-purity rule — on a merge-only main; a nightly trial rebase + fresh-build verification that never pushes, exit-code reporting, the patch-twin check for rewritten upstream history, the support-landed mode switch, and promotion as a separate guarded step (first run executed 2026-11-08 from aletheia-core under per-sync approval; standing ratification still pending)."
