The morning's daily goal grows out of the night-before thread

Morning synthesis rule: every morning, tie together something Will communicated the night before — the daily goal grows out of that thread. The morning commute call sets one daily goal for Emise to pursue quietly through his workday with minimal pings; an evening commute call is the exception, not a routine, and when one happens it is a working session like the morning commute.

