ive positions remain a validated research artifact. Docs: BUILD-REPORT.md generative addendum; ultra-phext-indexing-methods.md gains the third stage 'generation', marked measured-not-published. Bench: ~/workspace/ultra-phext/gen_positions.json + placement_gen.json + gen_validation*.json.
