- Invariant recorded: SSO handling stays downstream always — SSO band only rebases on top of the phext band, never enters phext-support or an upstream submission.
- Promotion ran from aletheia-core via git-over-SSH with force-with-lease on the two emise/* bands only; main advanced by merge. Executed under Will's per-task direction, not a standing ratification.
