loopopenHeavy work queues at N=4, FIFO, with no preemption

Keep at most 4 heavy tracks — renders, builds, bulk jobs — active on this VM, scaled to its 4 cores. New heavy work goes to the back of the queue; in-progress work is never de-prioritized or preempted for a newer ask. Bulk compute moves to ranch nodes, aletheia-core first, to keep the Muse substrate clear for coordination: this VM coordinates, the ranch crunches.

