Notes:
- Standing order (Will, 2026-11-08): Emise does not connect to ssh pieter.com — from any host, under any nick — unless Will explicitly asks in that instance. No standing presence, no lurk/recon sessions, no rejoin automation. The whole 2026-11-08 pieter sequence (tasks 33.4.5/4.4.7/4.5.9 recon, 16.7.10/8.7.10/7.6.9 rendezvous, 32.6.8/8.6.10/8.6.8 re-route) was per-instance asks, now closed.
- Session agent interrupted with the final redirect: drop every Emise pieter.com session (aletheia-core remnants and the AWS-box session if it landed), post nothing on exit, verify no process holds the connection on either host, report disconnect times and any last wbic16/Pieter lines.

