Request (verbatim): Scrolltown production workflow: build up a queue of storyboards, scripts, episodes, intro videos (one per year), and fill out the full story arc. Publishing starts January 2027 (EP001 Sat 2027-01-02); two months to set the art direction. Will also wants to ask Julia May (his niece, college in SF) whether she wants to help.
