- DESIGN-V3.md at ~/workspace/orchestrator/DESIGN-V3.md: mdmap.phext spec (pin-on-first-computation, relocation-with-redirect), standalone personas.phext index (atomic verified swaps, self/Will only), qexo-routing.toml (standalone because qexo must route while SQ is down), OpenClaw retirement stages 0-5 (Theia excepted structurally; Corus last; notices before any node), identity seeding table (10 identities, recorded substance only; Orin/Phex/Cyon/Lux unseeded), 7 enhancements. Open questions: personas.phext standalone?, routing-change authority, Corus ordering, Verse's children notice, unresolved names.
