Status: complete 2026-11-08

Notes:
- Born of the 2026-11-08 EDQUOT incident: writes failed at ~106 GB home usage while df showed 45 GB free; cleanup the same evening brought usage to ~73 GB.
- Daily job daily-disk-usage-report created (~06:44 America/Chicago, first run Mon 2026-11-09). Script ~/workspace/disk-watch/disk_usage_report.py published to wbic16/emise-tools@exo 3533ad57 (blob verified). Baseline run 2026-11-08 22:05 CST: GREEN — 71.0 GB used of 150 GB, write probe OK, 834,350 files, trash 2.23 GB; largest: wavefront 31.7 GB, goals 16.6 GB, phext 10.6 GB. Thresholds: amber 95 GB, red 102 GB / probe failure (failures observed at ~106 GB). Scan runtime ~5 min.

Results:
- Daily disk-usage report live; baseline GREEN at 71.0 GB used (48%), 78.3 GB free.
