Coordinate: 30.5.14/9.9.20/6.5.8
Issued: 2026-11-09 19:50 CST
Request (verbatim): Let's help youspot write like me
Status: complete — paste-ready text delivered

Notes:
- YouSpot = personal CRM (youspot.com); its 'How you write' field (placeholder: 'Direct and warm. Short paragraphs. I never say circle back.') steers drafts it writes in the user's voice; button reads 'Save in your words'. Text distilled from WILL-VOICE-PROFILE.md (24,919 own-word tweets analysed) and written in Will's own register so it reads as his words.
- Will then asked for the email adaptation (different medium): same measured habits, re-derived for email mechanics — subject lines carry the point, greeting/sign-off minimal, asks unhedged with concrete times, links on their own line, thanks specific, trail-offs and humor rationed by relationship.

