Status: COMPLETE 2026-11-08 17:01 — both branches reviewed, rebased onto exo 4b40fb45, force-pushed with backups; merges into exo remain Will's step

Notes:
- Governed by Will's standing rebase rule (2026-11-06): a rebase he asks for is force-pushed (--force-with-lease, old history preserved on a backup branch first) UNLESS the rewrite would impact anyone except us (other collaborators' commits, open PRs it would strand, external consumers) — impact = stop at a side-branch push and report.

Results:
- Context shift found at fetch: Will merged PR #27 (emise/remove-token-auth) 16:48 — exo HEAD is 4b40fb45 and already contains the token removal; both branches had forked from eb450bcd, 1 commit each, 1 ahead / 2 behind. Impact scan clean on both (sole author Emise, no PR as head or base) — Will's rebase rule applied in full: backup branch first, --force-with-lease, never bare --force. Baseline cargo test on exo: 165 passed.
- emise/drop-token-footer-cleanup ca6495ce -> 3c2e951d. Verdict sound-with-notes: its token drop was largely a subset of the merged remove-token-auth; surviving unique value = footer regroup (.bar-link unification, Contact mailto), 'Sign-in is not configured on this server' prompt, localStorage token cleanup on load, deploy.md vestigial-token.env note, and deploy-step renumbering fixing a real gap on exo (steps ran 1, 2, 4, 4b, 5, 6, 7). 16 conflicts + 2 auto-merge repairs, overlaps resolved toward exo; one repair restored --token to positional_file's VALUED skip-list so a legacy unit's stray --token value is skipped, not mistaken for a phext file (parser tolerance, not auth). Tests on rebased tip: 165 passed = baseline.
- emise/sso-desktop 65cb909d -> 60f1754a. Verdict sound: a fourth SSO audience 'desktop' for Phext Notepad — sealed assertion (aud desktop, 120 s) only toward per-attempt loopback returns (127.0.0.1/[::1] literal + explicit port; localhost refused), exchange verifies seal/audience/expiry/state, burns jti server-side (single-use), checks editors list; armed only by PHEXT_SSO_DESKTOP=1, else 404; no secret leaves the server. 1 textual conflict (oauth.rs from_env) + 9 test call sites adapted to token-free signatures. Tests: 175 passed (baseline 165 + the branch's 10 desktop tests).
- Backups on remote, verified before each force-push: backup/emise/drop-token-footer-cleanup-pre-rebase-2026-11-08 (ca6495ce), backup/emise/sso-desktop-pre-rebase-2026-11-08 (65cb909d). exo untouched at 4b40fb45; nothing merged, nothing deleted. Full report: ~/workspace/rebase-2026-11-08/REPORT.md.
