# Build OAuth 2.1 for edit.phext.io MCP (phase 2 — Chat-native clients)

Coordinate: 34.7.12/11.9.17/6.7.9
Issued: 2026-11-09 20:51 CST
Request (verbatim): Let's get OAuth 2.1 built - I want to go fully Chat-native :)
Status: COMPLETE — PR #42 merged by Will 2026-11-09 21:23 CST (2c72b68b) and deployed by Will ~21:4x CST; real clients reached discovery/registration/consent live. Interop bugs found by Will's client tests are task 32.5.8/6.6.10/7.5.9.

Notes:
- Phase 1 (PR #41, native /mcp) merged 20:22 CST (b111a3a1) but not yet deployed (awsbox at ac80d589); this build branches from b111a3a1 regardless. Design constraints: reuse Gate/session machinery, no static bearer resurrection (OAuth-issued per-user expiring tokens only, /mcp only), minimal scopes, tokens hashed at rest. Merge/deploy remain Will's + the standing route. After deploy: connect ChatGPT/Claude.ai connectors to https://edit.phext.io/mcp, then add mcpServerUrls to the Product Hunt listing.

Results:
- PR #42 (phext-lattice, emise/mcp-oauth21 @ 8d55edd6 on exo b111a3a1): full MCP OAuth 2.1 — RFC 9728 protected-resource metadata + WWW-Authenticate on /mcp 401s; RFC 8414 AS metadata (S256 only); RFC 7591 DCR (public none + confidential secret clients); CIMD implemented (ChatGPT's preferred path; only private_key_jwt deferred — ChatGPT also offers none); /oauth/authorize consent on the existing editor session/Gate (non-editor refused); /oauth/token auth-code + mandatory PKCE S256, rotating 30-day refresh, ~1h opaque access tokens, RFC 8707 resource audience binding, RFC 9207 iss; replay of code or rotated refresh revokes the token family. /mcp accepts OAuth Bearer (only /mcp), scopes phext:read / phext:write (default read, on the consent screen), token dies if the editor leaves the list; cookie path unchanged; no new dependencies or env secrets (HMAC digests domain-separated from the session secret; store mcp-oauth.json mode 0600). Tests 245 passed / 0 failed on aletheia-core (238 baseline + 7 new). Remaining: Will merges PR #42 + deploys (pull + deploy.sh — also lands phase 1), then connects ChatGPT app / Claude.ai connector to https://edit.phext.io/mcp.
- Live 2026-11-09: Cursor reached the consent screen (screenshot from Will); Claude/ChatGPT hit the DCR grant_types strictness bug (reproduced by Emise probe D); Grok reached consent on second attempt.
